<view class="page">
  <view class="card help-intro-card">
    <view class="card-title">帮助与反馈</view>
    <view class="muted small">如果您遇到功能问题、页面显示异常、数据问题或有功能建议，可以通过反馈问卷告诉我们。</view>
    <view class="muted tiny privacy-note">提交截图前，请注意遮挡姓名、联系方式等个人信息。请勿提交密码、身份证号等敏感信息。</view>
    <button class="button feedback-button" bindtap="copyFeedbackLink">复制反馈问卷链接</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card tutorial-card">
    <view class="card-title">使用说明</view>
    <view class="muted small">可重播完整教程或按功能查看操作说明。教程不会创建成绩、收藏或目标，也不会更改已有数据。</view>
    <button class="button full-button" bindtap="replayFullTutorial">重播完整 5 步教程</button>
    <button class="button secondary full-button" bindtap="replayDynamicHelp">重播状态型帮助</button>
    <view class="tutorial-grid">
      <button
        class="button secondary tutorial-button"
        wx:for="{{tutorials}}"
        wx:key="flow"
        data-flow="{{item.flow}}"
        bindtap="replayFeatureTutorial"
      >{{item.label}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">常见问题</view>
  <view class="card faq-card" wx:for="{{faqs}}" wx:key="question">
    <view class="card-title">{{item.question}}</view>
    <view class="muted faq-answer">{{item.answer}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
